          "page": 2,
          "section": "2.1. Sample preparation",
          "quote": "The Ti35Zr15Nb25Ta25 (at.%) MEA was fabricated from pure elemental nuggets with a minimum purity of 99.95 wt.% using an arc-melting furnace (AM200, Edmund Bühler GmbH) under a titanium-getter pure argon atmosphere. Firstly, five alloy buttons (~20 g) were fabricated. Each alloy button was remelted six times for chemical homogeneity (flipped before each remelting). During each round of melting, the melt was kept in the liquid state for 10 min.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "54a42309f1cc8f67:part:001"
